<section class="section" id="studio">
<div class="sec-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 - WOVEN PANELS</div><h2>Tenun sebagai shader</h2></div><p>Empat panel besar. Tiap panel pakai <b>ShaderMaterial</b> ringkas: vertex warp lembut + fragment weave/sheen. Gerak sheen jalan terus - hover percepat.</p></div>
<div class="marq" style="margin-bottom:14px" aria-hidden="true"><div class="marq-track" id="marqMat"></div></div>
<div class="woven-grid">
<article class="woven rv" data-sheen="silk"><div class="beam"></div><div class="spot"></div><canvas id="cv-silk" aria-hidden="true" width="560" height="220"></canvas><div class="woven-body"><div><h3>01 - Silk Drape</h3><p>Weave 28×28 · sheen specular 12-power · fold sinus</p></div><span class="tag">SILK · #d94a6a</span></div></article>
<article class="woven rv" data-sheen="linen"><div class="beam"></div><div class="spot"></div><canvas id="cv-linen" aria-hidden="true" width="560" height="220"></canvas><div class="woven-body"><div><h3>02 - Linen Weave</h3><p>Warp/weft 22×22 · slubs acak · AO tepi</p></div><span class="tag">LINEN · #ece6db</span></div></article>
<article class="woven rv" data-sheen="tartan"><div class="beam"></div><div class="spot"></div><canvas id="cv-tartan" aria-hidden="true" width="560" height="220"></canvas><div class="woven-body"><div><h3>03 - Tartan Plaid</h3><p>Overcheck + twill diagonal · palet navy/red/gold</p></div><span class="tag">TARTAN · #1a365d</span></div></article>
<article class="woven rv" data-sheen="bamboo"><div class="beam"></div><div class="spot"></div><canvas id="cv-bamboo" aria-hidden="true" width="560" height="220"></canvas><div class="woven-body"><div><h3>04 - Bamboo Mat</h3><p>Slat anyam · binding gelap · varnish halus</p></div><span class="tag">BAMBOO · #c9a86a</span></div></article>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section rv" id="hidup">
<div class="sec-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">04 - KOMPONEN HIDUP</div><h2>Tekstur yang bergerak</h2></div><p>Empat panel ringan: marquee nama material, dock etalase, grid partikel yang menolak kursor, dan laser sweep. Semua Canvas2D - tidak ada WebGL, tidak ada build.</p></div>
<div class="hidup-grid">
  <article class="hcard2"><div class="cap"><b>Particles - tolak kursor</b><span>magic/particles</span></div><canvas id="mPart" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><p class="note">40 titik; kursor mendorong yang terdekat. Garis muncul di bawah 70px.</p></article>
  <article class="hcard2"><div class="cap"><b>Laser - sweep</b><span>laser-01</span></div><canvas id="mLaser" role="img" aria-label="Laser sweep — klik untuk ganti mode" tabindex="0"></canvas><p class="note">Sapuan vertikal + grid latar. Klik kanvas untuk mengganti mode.</p></article>
</div>
<div style="margin-top:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:20px;padding:16px">
  <div class="dock" id="mDock" role="list" aria-label="Etalase material"></div>
  <p style="text-align:center;font-size:.68rem;color:var(--mut);margin-top:10px">Dock - hover untuk membesar, klik untuk memantul.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section rv" id="angka">
<div class="sec-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">05 - ANGKA STUDIO</div><h2>Koleksi dalam hitungan</h2></div><p>Penghitung naik saat bagian ini terlihat. Bukan metrik pasar - ini jumlah material yang dirawat.</p></div>
<div class="ticks" id="ticks">
  <div class="tick"><b id="tk1">0</b><s>Panel woven</s></div>
  <div class="tick"><b id="tk2">0</b><s>Brand orb</s></div>
  <div class="tick"><b id="tk3">0</b><s>Device</s></div>
  <div class="tick"><b id="tk4">0</b><s>Swatch</s></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="koleksi">
<div class="sec-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 - BRAND ORBS</div><h2>23 material partner</h2></div><p>Grid floating - tiap orb chrome dengan highlight. Klik untuk pulse. Bukan harga, tapi asal serat & proses.</p></div>
<div class="orbs-wrap"><div class="orbs" id="orbs"></div></div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="atelier">
<div class="sec-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">03 - DEVICE SHOWCASE</div><h2>Lookbook di 8 device</h2></div><p>LS-graphics frames: iPhone · iPad · MacBook · Watch - di-grid sebagai etalase koleksi, bukan dashboard trading.</p></div>
<div class="devices" id="devices"></div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="journal" style="padding-bottom:40px">
<div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:20px;padding:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:16px">
<div><div class="eyebrow">JOURNAL</div><h3 style="font-family:Onest,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:900;margin-top:6px">Cara pakai materi</h3><p style="color:var(--mut);font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.7;margin-top:8px">Pilih panel → lihat sheen & weave di scale besar. Cocokkan dengan orb (asal serat). Lalu cek di device: silk untuk cover premium, linen untuk everyday, tartan untuk statement, bamboo untuk alas & packaging.</p></div>
<div style="background:#f7f5f1;color:#111;border-radius:16px;padding:16px"><div style="font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.12em;opacity:.6">SWATCH GRID</div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:10px" id="swatches"></div><div style="font-size:.68rem;opacity:.78;margin-top:10px">Tap swatch → hero ikut ganti nuansa.</div></div>
</div>
</section>

